error[E0277]: `own::Extend` is an event of the lease form
  --> tests/ui/manual_extend.rs:14:18
   |
14 |     type Table = InboxSpec<(own::Extend,)>;
   |                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `own::Extend` outside the lease form
   |
   = help: the trait `ExtendInLease` is not implemented for `(Unset, Set<ruststream_sqlx::spec::own::Extend>)`
   = note: set the lease form with `.lease(..)` and `Lease<..>`, or drop `.own::<own::Extend>()` and `own::Extend`
help: the following other types implement trait `ExtendInLease`
  --> src/inbox/spec/rules.rs
   |
   | impl<Form> ExtendInLease for (Form, Unset) {}
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `(Form, Unset)`
   | impl<Time> ExtendInLease for (Set<Lease<Time>>, Set<own::Extend>) {}
   | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `(Set<ruststream_sqlx::spec::Lease<Time>>, Set<ruststream_sqlx::spec::own::Extend>)`
   = note: required for `InboxSpec<(ruststream_sqlx::spec::own::Extend,)>` to implement `Valid`
note: required by a bound in `ruststream_sqlx::InboxTable::Table`
  --> src/inbox/spec/builder.rs
   |
   |     type Table: Valid;
   |                 ^^^^^ required by this bound in `InboxTable::Table`

